@startuml
[*] --> InitialState
InitialState --> FileUpload : User uploads file
FileUpload --> AccessLevelConfiguration : Configure access levels
AccessLevelConfiguration --> Sharing : Share file with conditions
Sharing --> AccessGranted : Access granted based on conditions
Sharing --> AccessRevoked : Access revoked/conditions not met
AccessGranted --> [*] : Access active
AccessRevoked --> [*] : Access denied
@enduml
